WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.028 --> 00:00:06.025
Start from Monitor & Test.

2
00:00:06.035 --> 00:00:10.426
Open Settings when key input needs to be tested.

3
00:00:10.455 --> 00:00:15.185
Click Start Test to watch joystick directions.

4
00:00:15.201 --> 00:00:20.785
Move each direction and confirm the matching indicator.

5
00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:27.315
Use gate tests one gate at a time.

6
00:00:27.324 --> 00:00:31.193
Confirm the Activity Log shows a clean result.
